    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_02",
      "hash64": "794C3BF237DE32D5",
      "text": "Mes remerciements pour ce que tu as fait pour\\nle Club de la Ligue et... pour Kassis.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_03",
      "hash64": "794C3AF237DE3122",
      "text": "Tu es devenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse. Kassis a perdu sa place\\net a quitté le classement du club.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_04",
      "hash64": "794C35F237DE28A3",
      "text": "Bien sûr, ce n’est pas comme si nous n’allions\\nplus nous voir...\\c\\nNéanmoins, je ne vais pas le nier, ce changement\\nde paradigme me rend un peu triste.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_05",
      "hash64": "794C34F237DE26F0",
      "text": "Mais plus que tout... je suis heureuse qu’il soit\\nà nouveau celui qu’il était.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_06",
      "hash64": "794C37F237DE2C09",
      "text": "J’étais d’ailleurs tellement ravie que j’ai préparé\\nun grand nombre de comprimés. Ceux que\\r\\ntu as utilisés lors du défi.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_12",
      "hash64": "7948B1F237DB1280",
      "text": "Quand tu voudras t’envoler avec monsieur Agrou,\\ntu pourras lui en donner la quantité appropriée.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_01",
      "hash64": "0D2282BD495E0C0C",
      "text": "Grouh !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_02",
      "hash64": "0D2285BD495E1125",
      "text": "*scrontch* *scrontch*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_13",
      "hash64": "7948B2F237DB1433",
      "text": "Ah. Tu lui donnes les comprimés maintenant ?\\nCeci n’est pas conforme au protocole.\\c\\nMonsieur Agrou, vous ne pouvez pas tout avaler\\nd’un coup...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_03",
      "hash64": "0D2284BD495E0F72",
      "text": "Graouh !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_system_01",
      "hash64": "1EA3E8AF2CA275D4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)] a appris la capacité\\nde monture Vol !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_07",
      "hash64": "794C36F237DE2A56",
      "text": "... Tiens donc. Ces comprimés auraient aussi\\nle potentiel de renforcer ses aptitudes ?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_08",
      "hash64": "794C41F237DE3D07",
      "text": "Monsieur Agrou semble maintenant pouvoir voler\\nde façon permanente. Voilà qui est intéressant.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_09",
      "hash64": "794C40F237DE3B54",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, j’ai créé un nouveau parcours\\npour la course aérienne contre la montre.\\c\\nTu peux le tester, mais attention, il demande\\nune grande expertise.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_10",
      "hash64": "7948B3F237DB15E6",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, lorsque tu auras terminé\\nla course aérienne contre la montre au niveau\\r\\ndifficile, tu pourras essayer le niveau expert,\\r\\nsi tu t’en sens capable.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 169,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_11",
      "hash64": "7948B4F237DB1799",
      "text": "... Sur ce, il est temps pour moi de partir.\\nAu revoir.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
